# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Orgrimmar (Ripple Delivery, training) -> fly to Camp Mojache -> Feralas (Uzer'i's
# chain, the hippogryphs, sprite darters and forest walkers, Zorbin Fandazzle and the zapped giants on
# the Forgotten Coast, the Northspring harpies, the Rage Scar yetis) -> Camp Mojache -> fly to
# Gadgetzan (Sprinkle) -> Marvon Rivetseeker -> the boat to Powderfuse Port, where the next guide
# starts.
#
# Wild Hearts (3123) comes back from the Hinterlands, so Uzer'i's chain waits for this visit.

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 81                             -- Dran Droffers, the Drag
  accept 4300                           -- Jes'rimon, the Cleft of Shadow: the ravasaur claws are from Un'Goro, around level 53
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Fly to Thunder Bluff
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.8 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Class trainer
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  train class only Druid

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Thunder Bluff
  train class only Druid,Paladin

step Fly to Camp Mojache
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Camp Mojache"
  zone Feralas

