  accept 3124
  accept 3380

step Frayfeather Hippogryphs
  tip The hippogryphs nest on the hills south-west of the camp. Kill one, then use the Muisek Vessel on its body.
  collect 9595 quest 3124
  use 9619 quest 3124.1 @58.0,62.8 map 1444

step Frayfeather hippogryphs
  tip South of the vale the Frayfeather hippogryphs roost on the slopes; nearly every one drops sinew and metallic fragments.
  collect 9591 quest 3128.3
  collect 9592 quest 3128.4

step Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  turnin 3124
