step Sprite Darters
  tip The faerie dragons flit around the woods just west of the camp. Use the vessel on each one you kill.
  collect 9596 quest 3125
  use 9620 quest 3125.1 @70.2,46.6 map 1444

step Sprite darters and forest walkers
  tip The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of the camp and carry the Encrusted Minerals; the Wandering Forest Walkers, a little further west, carry the Splintered Logs.
  collect 9589 quest 3128.2 @68.0,47.5 map 1444
  collect 9590 quest 3128.1 @54.0,47.2 map 1444

