step Wandering Forest Walkers
  tip The treants wander the forest roads between the camp and the middle of Feralas; there are only a few, so look along the paths.
  collect 9593 quest 3126
  use 9606 quest 3126.1 @73.9,38.8 map 1444

step Witch Doctor Uzer'i
