step Northspring harpies
  tip The Northspring harpies nest on the ridges in the far north-west. The Windcallers heal, so kill them first and pull one at a time.
  kill 5362 quest 3063.1
  kill 5363 quest 3063.2
  kill 5364 quest 3063.3
  kill 5366 quest 3063.4

step Rage Scar yetis
  tip On the way back south-east from the harpies, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills by the road. Any of them can also drop a Perfect Yeti Hide, which starts a quest of its own.
  collect 18947 quest 7734.1
  collect 18972 optional                -- Perfect Yeti Hide, a rare drop
  accept 7738 optional

